        "",
        "アックァ",
        "Emt7_Ama",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "た、確かにその通りですね！\n……と、止まりました。\nでも、また歩こうとすると……足が真横に出ちゃうんです……。",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "アックァ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "18f52d6a4188017c9b3287873cd001f585d250ee6c7dd0462c7506f1e179090f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "とりあえず手を貸してください。\nアックァさんを前に引っ張りますから、\nそれに合わせて前に歩いて貰えればいいと思いますよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "fba6e82867a76390cc59451d7755abe5fef24258fcd5c0506b76247ff46bf1f3",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "일단 손을 주세요.\n제가 아쿠아 씨를 앞으로 끌어당길 테니\n그에 맞춰 앞쪽으로 걸으면 될 것 같아요.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 36,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b63eb9bb1002e385109b2a2583f4f7ecbb9918f037400a09f6afa09ee014347c:000001_-2161626237486627377:g0:r35",
      "row_index_0based": 35,
      "serialized_row_index": 35,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "とりあえず手を貸してください。\nアックァさんを前に引っ張りますから、\nそれに合わせて前に歩いて貰えればいいと思いますよ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6013d12d73edd67b0e8c7fd0c672fb6536294683310effba2ab3df4fe8111c32",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "えっ、手を……ですか？\nでも、私の手はハサミですし、\nご主人様に万が一怪我をさせたりしたら……。",
      "jp_sha256": "eee1a2c0913ccc253327d3c6508b2a98407f972290ec97f0f5a2215b0fcfad64",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "네, 손을……말인가요?\n하지만 제 손은 집게라서\n혹시라도 주인님을 다치게 하면…….",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 59,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
